    "title": "UConn women's hockey to host Northeastern for Hockey East Championship",
    "text": "The University of Connecticut women’s hockey team, seeded second, is set to face top-seeded Northeastern in the Hockey East Championship. The game will take place on Saturday, March 7 at 3:30 p.m. at the Toscano Family Ice Forum in Storrs.\nTickets for the championship match can be purchased through UConn’s official ticketing website at UConnTickets.com.\nParking options for attendees include the South Parking Garage, which charges by the hour, and I-Lot East with a flat rate of $15 payable in cash.",
